From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:53:13 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 101/102] ui-egui, app: turn off upstream community chrome,
 brand marks and update check under the overlay

With OFFICE_OVERLAY_DIR set at build time: the ArtCraft wordmark and mark are not compiled in
(the overlay icon is drawn instead), the Discord button, the Home community card and the
About 'Part of' row are not drawn, the community/website help commands are hidden and
inert, and the update source is not installed (no network call, no menu entry).
Every change is gated on constants from office_overlay; without an overlay the behaviour
is upstream's.
---
 apps/pdfcraft/src/main.rs      |  4 +++-
 crates/ui-egui/src/chrome.rs   | 11 +++++++---
 crates/ui-egui/src/commands.rs |  8 ++++---
 crates/ui-egui/src/dialogs.rs  | 10 +++++----
